{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29816","headline":"天平公座中呈令狐令公时蔡京在坐京曾爲僧徒故有第五句 · 李商隐","name":"天平公座中呈令狐令公时蔡京在坐京曾爲僧徒故有第五句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"罢执霓旌上醮坛，慢粧娇树水晶盘。\n更深欲诉蛾眉歛，衣薄临醒玉艳寒。\n白足禅僧思败道，青袍御史拟休官。\n虽然同是将军客，不敢公然子细看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}